Sample Data
This folder contains anonymised sample data for demonstration purposes.
Real patient and business data is not included in this repository.
Data Structure
Drugs.csv
Column	Type	Description
DrugID	String	Unique drug identifier (e.g. D001)
DrugName	String	Drug name (raw)
Standardized DrugName	String	Cleaned and standardised name
Category	String	Drug category (e.g. Antibiotic, Analgesic)
UnitPrice	Integer	Selling price per unit
CostPrice	Integer	Cost price per unit
ShelfLifeMonths	Integer	Shelf life in months
ManufactureDate	Date	Date of manufacture
ExpiryDate	Date	Expiry date
Customers.csv
Column	Type	Description
CustomerID	String	Unique customer identifier (e.g. C001)
CustomerName	String	Hospital or pharmacy name
CustomerType	String	Hospital / Pharmacy / Wholesaler
City	String	Customer city
JoinDate	Date	Date customer joined
Sales.csv
Column	Type	Description
SalesID	String	Unique sale identifier (e.g. S001)
CustomerID	String	Foreign key → Customers
DrugID	String	Foreign key → Drugs
Quantity	Integer	Units sold
SaleDate	Date	Date of sale
Revenue	Integer	Quantity × UnitPrice
UnitPrice	Integer	Price at time of sale
Profit	Integer	Revenue − Cost
SalesMonth	String	Month label (e.g. 2025-01)
